    LLM: "Game: Bartok. Type: Shedding Meta-Game. Rules: Match suit/rank. 7 cards each. Features: Penultimate card requires 'Bartok' call. Round winner creates a new permanent rule for subsequent rounds.",
    Player: "The 5 of Spades is on the pile. You have 3 cards. It's round 4, and remember the rule from round 2: 'You must clap before playing a Spade'. Do you have a match? And don't forget to call Bartok when you're down to your last card.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to shed all cards from your hand in a round. The ultimate goal is to win the round and implement a rule that benefits you or hinders your rivals.',
    gameplay: 'On your turn, you must play a card that matches either the **Suit** or the **Rank** of the top card on the discard pile. If you cannot play, you must draw one card from the deck. If that card is playable, you may play it immediately.',
